OverlapMix-DD

This project includes a substantially reorganized implementation of ideas and
code patterns from RDED ("On the Diversity and Realism of Distilled Dataset",
CVPR 2024), originally distributed under the Apache License 2.0:
https://github.com/LINs-lab/RDED

The package layout, overlap-aware compositor, command-line interface, tests,
configuration validation, and documentation in this repository are modified
or newly written for this project.

